OL,3,GNEWSAWife drugged and raped by husband 
OL,4,Aasked police if she was to blame, court
OL,5,Ahears                                  
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains         
OL,8,Fdistressing content                    
OL,10,FA woman who had been drugged and raped 
OL,11,Fby her husband for 20 years asked      
OL,12,Fpolice: "Is it my fault he's done      
OL,13,Fthis?", a court heard.                 
OL,15,FThe husband, who cannot be named to    
OL,16,Fprotect his wife's right to anonymity, 
OL,17,Fhas admitted a litany of offences      
OL,18,Fagainst her - including rape,          
OL,19,Fadministering a substance with intent  
OL,20,Fand inviting 13 other men to join the  
OL,21,Fabuse.                                 
